      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:17vd8p3'
    '|a||So for them the true value line sits above the one we drew, and part of the triangle isn''t waste at all.':
